{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國華盛頓發生槍擊案，至少1死4傷，據報疑兇吞槍自盡。</p><p></p><p>警方當地周四早上拉起封鎖線，案發現場距離白宮約1.5公里，又指疑兇是一名白人男子，相信是單獨犯案，部分傷者情況嚴重。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SHOOTING-0030.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026EV8b4tN5bp1794499640.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>當地傳媒報道，疑兇是健身室成員，懷疑跟大廈業主立案法團負責人爭執，他先在健身室內開槍，再走到街上襲擊其他人。有目擊者稱當時健身室約有50人，疑兇跟警方對峙期間，向自己頸部開槍自盡，現場非常混亂。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SHOOTING-0030_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fy4Q8Z4bHM1794499704.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>警方在現場搜獲一把手槍，正調查行兇動機。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.US.SHOOTING-0030_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026bir3bJq8pR1794499724.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T17:24:27.189671+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T16:09:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T18:37:37.361864+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T17:17:42.387092+00:00","content_hash":"58687d588faa94ab1e583f0cf1277d28ce700cfb4fe6883b51bace166fe7793b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}